=== WTI_BETA_60
 expr: beta(asset_ret, WTI_ret, 60)
=== dxy_beta_60
 expr: beta(asset_ret, DXY_ret, 60)
=== kurt_20
 expr: rolling_kurtosis(pct_change(close), 20, min_periods=8) = m4/m2^2 - 3, where m2,m4 are rolling 20d 2nd/4th central moments of daily returns
=== mom_10d_skip5
 expr: close.shift(5) / close.shift(15) - 1.0
=== mom_120d_skip5
 expr: close.shift(5) / close.shift(125) - 1.0
=== semi_down_ratio_20
 expr: sqrt(mean(min(pct_change,0)^2,20))/sqrt(mean(max(pct_change,0)^2,20)) - 1
=== time_under_water_120
 expr: days_since_last_rolling_max(close, 120)
=== trend_r2_30_signed
 expr: sign(cov) * cov^2 / (var(t) * var(log_close)) over trailing 30d, where cov = rolling cov(log_close, t); result is the signed R^2 of an OLS fit of log-price on time, sign = direction of the slope.
=== vix_beta_cond_60x20
 expr: -beta(asset_ret, VIX_ret, 60) * (VIX/VIX.shift(20) - 1.0)
=== vol_of_vol20x60
 expr: std(pct_change,20).rolling(60).std()

