===== trend_r2_30_signed
 calc: sign(cov) * cov^2 / (var(t) * var(log_close)) over trailing 30d, where cov = rolling cov(log_close, t); result is the signed R^2 of an OLS fit of log-price on time, sign = direction of the slope.
 deps: ['close']
 params: {'window': 30, 'min_periods_ratio': 0.6, 'min_periods': 18, 'admission_horizon': 10}

===== semi_down_ratio_20
 calc: sqrt(mean(min(pct_change,0)^2,20))/sqrt(mean(max(pct_change,0)^2,20)) - 1
 deps: ['close']
 params: {'win': 20, 'horizon': 10, 'min_valid_assets': 8}

===== kurt_20
 calc: rolling_kurtosis(pct_change(close), 20, min_periods=8) = m4/m2^2 - 3, where m2,m4 are rolling 20d 2nd/4th central moments of daily returns
 deps: ['close']
 params: {'window': 20, 'min_periods': 8, 'admission_horizon': 10}

===== vix_beta_cond_60x20
 calc: -beta(asset_ret, VIX_ret, 60) * (VIX/VIX.shift(20) - 1.0)
 deps: ['close', 'VIX']
 params: {'beta_win': 60, 'vix_win': 20}

===== dxy_beta_60
 calc: beta(asset_ret, DXY_ret, 60)
 deps: ['close', 'DXY']
 params: {'beta_window': 60, 'horizon': 10, 'min_valid_assets': 8}

