expr: beta(asset_ret, DXY_ret, 60)
desc: Rolling 60-day beta of each asset's daily returns to the US dollar index (DXY): cov(asset_ret, DXY_ret, 60)/var(DXY_ret, 60). Captures persistent dollar-sensitivity; assets with higher DXY-beta tend to outperform over the 10d horizon (positive IC).
deps: ['close', 'DXY']

